          .proof
            %h6#proof_3 Proof
            %p
              There are many characterizations of Prüfer domains, but one is that the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/lattice"} lattice
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ideals"} ideals
              is
              = succeed "," do
