                  %mo →
                  %mi ℝ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{R}
            which can be defined by a first-order formula, starting with the basic operations
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} +
